  d245: ['Golden Parry','Charges after Borrowed Force have a 1-second Peak Timing window after full charge.'],
  d246: ['Fourfold Drain','At quarter, half, three-quarter and full charge, drain 15 extra health from nearby enemies. Store actual health drained as heavy damage.'],
  d247: ['Ride the Momentum','Follow-through first-hit pursuit reaches farther and gains an extra 80% health and posture damage.'],
  d248: ['Skyfall Impact','High-altitude downward landings trigger a great Quake Stomp. Greater starting height adds damage, up to +60%.'],
  d249: ['Bloodletting','Heavies inflict bleeding for 18 damage per second for 10 seconds and increase bleeding damage taken by 80% for 5 seconds.'],
  d250: ['Wind Swordplay','With enough wind, attacks release a whirlwind for 70 health and 90 posture damage. Every third whirlwind is stronger.'],
  d251: ['Calm Focus','Entering meditation immediately fills 10 flow stacks. They do not decay from standing still during meditation.'],
  d252: ['Traveling Sanctuary','Entering Consecrated Ground refreshes its duration and makes it slowly follow you.'],
  d253: ['Thorn Song','Melee attacks during Starlight invulnerability release thorns around you. Higher incoming damage gives stronger counterattacks.'],
  d254: ['Accelerant','Damage over time ticks twice as fast, with half the duration.'],
  d255: ['Legion Tactics','Learn techniques from summons. Summon kills also grant technique kill rewards.'],
  d256: ['Command the Dead','Skeletons prioritize nearby bounty targets. Duration +30%.'],
  d257: ['Touch Builds Heat','Searing Touch contact damage also builds heat and triggers Friction Fire.'],
  d258: ['Fated Wounds','Arriving enemies accumulate hidden wounds equal to 18% maximum health, or 4% for bosses.'],
  d259: ['Enslavement','Mind-controlled enemies gain your attack speed and attack damage bonuses.'],
  d260: ['Healthy Living','All healing effects +20%. Healing can exceed maximum health by 25%.'],
