  d267: ['Evasion Blade Wheel','Successful evasion releases an extra Ring Blade at 80% effectiveness. Cooldown: 0.38 seconds.'],
  d268: ['Sword-forging Guide','Faster blade growth: 3% every 4 levels, with a growth cap of 50%.'],
  d269: ['Explosive Puppet','Mind-controlled enemy deaths leave enhanced corpse explosions with greater range, base damage 96 health and 58 posture, and stronger random damage-over-time effects.'],
  d270: ['Ledger of the Dead','Each skeleton attack adds 7 hidden wound damage plus 13% of its damage.'],
  d271: ['Dismantle Techniques','Exploiting an opening adds an extra 10% health and posture damage and experience equal to 3% of the enemy\'s reward.'],
  d272: ['Veil of Night','Starting Starlight channeling immediately grants stealth. Movement speed +28% during channeling.'],
  d273: ['Shadow Assault','Entering stealth turns phantoms into soul-seeking rushes for 85 health and 50 posture damage, then they vanish.'],
  d274: ['Lethal Hidden Wounds','When applying damage over time, accumulated hidden wounds also help Catalyst detonate enemies.'],
  d275: ['Triple Bell Toll','Both bell aftershocks gain the same health damage, posture damage and posture-break chance as the main toll.'],
  d276: ['Every Grudge Repaid','Marking a revenge target also applies Doom.'],
  d277: ['Imbalance','Perfect-blocking a linked target removes extra posture from all enemies in its link group: 20 plus 5% maximum posture.'],
  d278: ['Electrodynamics','Activating a lightning orb detonates all lightning marks on the battlefield.'],
  d279: ['Proxy Execution','Ghost Hand quickly executes suppressed posture-broken targets, shocks nearby posture, and restores spirit.'],
  d280: ['Black Hole Gauntlet','Approaching a black hole center extends its duration by 0.85 seconds and makes it follow you.'],
  d281: ['Armor-splitting Stone Nail','Stone Thrust hits leave stone nails. Armor-rending attacks or posture breaks detonate them for an extra 52 health damage and 52 plus 10% maximum posture damage, with 55% effect on nearby enemies.'],
  d282: ['Bell Shock','At full Resonance, perfect blocks have a 15% chance to toll a small bell; boss executions always trigger it. Restore 7 health and damage all enemies, with greater damage nearby.'],
  d283: ['Wind-chasing Second Form','First combo hits preserve wind. Second hits spend it for a rapid advance with larger range and briefly evade attacks.'],
  d284: ['Triple Return Blade','Return Blade bonuses after perfect block last for 3 attacks.'],
  d285: ['Eternal Six-sided Die','Each level-up gives every on-screen enemy an 80% chance to suffer Doom.'],
  d286: ['Crushing Hand','Every 7.2 seconds, Ghost Hand crushes a random non-boss enemy and fears nearby enemies for 2.6 seconds.'],
  d287: ['Sister\'s Prayer','Ending a dash detonates all lightning marks on enemies around the endpoint.'],
  d288: ['Demon Hunter','Gain an additional independent bounty mark that only marks nonhumanoid enemies.'],
  d289: ['Mark of the Weak','First Strike leaves a hunting mark for 1 second. Marked enemies are instantly killed below 30% health.'],
  d290: ['Mind-shattering Resonance','At full Resonance, perfect blocks deal 26 plus 9% maximum health damage nearby and break posture on enemies at or below 28% health.'],
  d291: ['Power of the Sun','Starlight channeling and invulnerability also grant Ultimate Form bonuses.'],
  d292: ['Multiple Space Slashes','Charged heavies create more space slashes with longer charges, up to 4 at full charge.'],
  d293: ['Rift Consumption','Heavies can hit sealed enemies, immediately banishing them and triggering Space Slash.'],
  d294: ['Space-rending Wave','Each enemy hit by a giant blade wave has a 40% chance to trigger Space Slash.'],
  d295: ['Subspace Assault','Execution rushes leave space rifts along the path. They detonate together at the end for 75 damage.'],
  d296: ['Spatial Rebound','Space Slash adds 36 posture damage. Perfect blocks also trigger a space slash.'],
  d297: ['Dark Arts','After blocking, the next dash leaves space rifts along its path. They detonate together 0.3 seconds after the dash for 75 damage.'],
  d298: ['Blizzard','Merged great tornadoes continuously slow enemies to 48% movement speed and apply a frost stack every 0.6 seconds, triggering frostbite and freezing.'],
  d299: ['Careful Selection','Ascension choices earned from Refinement boss kills also grant an extra unchosen ascension from the same page after choosing.'],
  d300: ['Enhanced Bounty','Bounty target kills grant extra experience equal to 5% of current level-up requirements.'],
  d301: ['Shadow Terror','Ending stealth fears nearby enemies for 1.8 seconds.'],
  d302: ['Dive Harvest','Dive Bomb deals +80% damage to enemies at or below 60% health and kills enemies below 15% health.'],
  d303: ['Reload','Normal blocks shorten Dive Bomb cooldown by 0.75 seconds; perfect blocks shorten it by 1.5 seconds.'],
  d304: ['Dragonfire Storm','Hatchling fire tornado range +50%, with stronger damage, burning, pulling and launches.'],
  d305: ['Rank-breaking Resonance','Each Resonance stack grants Rank Breaker +25% posture damage and +12% range, up to 4 stacks.'],
  d306: ['Spirit Brand','Spirit Burst leaves an 8-second brand: health damage taken +20%, posture damage taken +25%. Branded kills restore 8 extra spirit.'],
  d307: ['Combo Reward','Consecutive technique kills grant food when the kill chain ends. A longer chain grants larger food.'],
  d308: ['Berserk Blade','Swift Blades stack cap becomes 8. Each stack grants an extra 4% attack speed.'],
  d309: ['Blood Rage','Higher spirit extends invulnerability after being hit: +0.5% per spirit point.'],
  d310: ['No Rest in Eternity','Linked target deaths have a 30% chance to transfer the link to a nearby unlinked enemy and extend its remaining duration.'],
  d311: ['Enhanced Soul Blade','Each soul blade has a 15% chance to be enhanced, dealing +50% damage to its main target and applying Soul Link.'],
