  d166: ['Wildfire','Higher movement speed increases fire trail damage and duration, and applied burning duration, up to +65%.'],
  d167: ['Divine Light','At full health inside Consecrated Ground, strike enemies inside with holy light every 1.5 seconds for 81 health and 63 posture damage.'],
